es. How to Express Interest Expressions of interest are reviewed on a rolling basis. Please submit a cover letter, CV, and the contact information of three references. About UMass Dartmouth UMass Dartmouth has transformed the lives of 40,000 alumni and distinguishes itself as a vibrant, public research university dedicated to engaged learning and innovative research. It is the only Massachusetts Tier 1 national research university south of Boston. Located on a beautiful 710-acre suburban campus on the South Coast of Massachusetts, UMass Dartmouth offers faculty the opportunity to work alongside talented students and colleagues in a community defined by genuine support and dedication. Advertised: 10 Jul 2026 Eastern Daylight Time Back to search results Apply now Refer a friend Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App Send me jobs like these We will email you new jobs that match this search. Great, we can send you jobs like this, if this is your first time signing up, please check your inbox to confirm your subscription. The email address was invalid, please check for errors. You must agree to the privacy statement Subscribe Recaptcha Privacy agreement Search results Position Closes Part-Time Lecturer - First Year English The University of Massachusetts Dartmouth is looking for talented individuals with an interest in working as First Year English Part-Time Lecturers in the English & Communication Department. Current opportunities Position Closes Part-Time Lecturer - First Year English The University of Massachusetts Dartmouth is looking for talented individuals with an interest in working as First Year English Part-Time Lecturers in the English & Communication Department. Expression of interest No expression of interest currently available Powered by PageUp The University of Massachusetts Dartmouth welcomes all qualified applicants and complies with all state and federal anti-discrimination laws. Clery Disclosure Notice of Availability In compliance with the Jeanne Clery