      "title": "Teaching. Scholarship. Engagement.",
      "description": "Office of Faculty Development | UMass Dartmouth Skip to main content Support UMassD Directory Check My Status myUMassD University of Massachusetts Dartmouth Search UMass Dartmouth Menu About Admissions Academics Research Outreach Student Life Athletics Alumni & Friends Office of Faculty Development Toggle navigation from this section Close In this section About Staff and Advisory Board Location & Office Hours Programs & Events Workshops Faculty Reading Groups Share Your Research Writing Retreats Resources Planning for Promotion Resources for Teaching & Learning Resources for Scholarship & Professional Activity Office of Research Administration Provost's Resources for Faculty Grants, Awards & Other Opportunities Scholarship & Teaching Development Grants New Faculty Institute Getting Started New Faculty Orientation Welcome to the Southcoast Sitemap In this section About Programs & Events Resources Grants, Awards & Other Opportunities New Faculty Institute Sitemap Toggle share controls Share on Facebook Share this on X Share on LinkedIn Print this page Email this page Copy URL Link copied to clipboard! University of Massachusetts Dartmouth HOME Academics // Office of Faculty Development Office of Faculty Development Teaching. Scholarship. Engagement. Advocating for the professional development of faculty at every stage of their academic careers. About the OFD Learn more about our mission and vision for faculty success at UMassD. New Faculty Institute Mentoring new faculty and providing support for successful teaching and research. Programs & Events Discover the OFD’s interdisciplinary workshops, conferences, reading groups, and ongoing programming devoted to teaching and scholarship. Grants, Fellowships, and Other Opportunities Support for teaching innovation, scholarly publications and presentations, and creative work. Resources for Scholarship and Professional Activities Access materials related to scholarly research, writing, publication, and creative work. Resources for Teaching & Learning Access materials related to pedagogy, course design and development, and assessment across modalities. Contact Office of Faculty Development 508-999-9182 ofd@umassd.edu Claire T. Carney Library , 212 Office Hours Monday through Thursday 8:30 am - 4:30 pm Fridays 8:30 am - 12:00 pm Location & Office Hours Back to top of page Visit us from anywhere, at any time. Take a virtual tour of the UMass Dartmouth campus. Visit us virtually University of Massachusetts Dartmouth 285 Old Westport Road, Dartmouth, MA 02747-2300 Extraordinary is what we do. ® Facebook X (Twitter) Instagram TikTok YouTube Linked in Directions Jobs at UMassD Annual Security Report Privacy Site Map Contact myUMassD Support UMassD Directory Apply Visit Request Info Check Application Status Accessibility Report an accessibility issue Dark Mode Off © 2026 University of Massachusetts Dartmouth + t 4 Close main menu Check My Status myUMassD Support UMassD Directory Search UMass Dartmouth About Accreditation History of UMass Dartmouth Mission and Vision Location Fast Facts Points of Distinction Event Calendar Chancellor's Office Feature Stories News & Press Releases Video Giving Administration UMass System Social Media Flags Staff Directory Contact Accessibility at UMass Dartmouth Help Admissions Apply to UMass Dartmouth Undergraduate Admissions Graduate Admissions UMass Dartmouth Online International Admissions Check your application status Academics Academic Calendar Academic Programs Academic Resource Center Catalogs Centers Claire T. Carney Library Colleges and Schools Courses Faculty Graduate Programs Interdisciplinary Programs International Programs Office Office of Faculty Development Provost Registrar Sigma Xi STEM Student Success UMass Dartmouth Online University Studies Research About Research at UMassD Research Offices Contact Us Openings Outreach Business Engagement Center Campus Sustainability Early College Partnerships Economic Development Govern